OL,3,GNEWSADrug-driving arrest after lorry   
OL,4,Acrash shuts road                       
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fdrug-driving after a lorry left the    
OL,8,Froad and crashed closing the A36 in    
OL,9,FHampshire.                             
OL,11,FNational Highways said the road is shut
OL,12,Fin both directions between the A3090   
OL,13,Fnear Ower and the A27 near Whiteparish 
OL,14,Fafter the HGV "overturned" on Wednesday
OL,15,Fat about 16:00 GMT.                    
