OL,3,GNEWSADrug-driving arrest after lorry   
OL,4,Acrash shuts road                       
OL,6,FPolice said a 48-year-old man had been 
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of driving a     
OL,8,Fmotor vehicle whilst over the specified
OL,9,Fdrug limit. He has been released from  
OL,10,Fcustody but remains under              
OL,11,Finvestigation. No injuries were        
OL,12,Freported.                              
OL,14,FThe vehicle is being recovered and the 
OL,15,Fscene is being cleared, with drivers   
OL,16,Furged to allow extra time for their    
OL,17,Fjourney and follow signed diversion    
OL,18,Froutes.                                
